# Campus Placement Management System Details

Here is the complete overview of the system features, roles, and current login credentials.

## 👤 User Roles & Capabilities

The application has been streamlined to only use **two** user roles, as requested. The Recruiter role has been completely removed.

### 1. Placement Cell (Admin)
The college placement cell uses this role to manage the platform and students.

**Features:**
- Add, Edit, and Delete Companies
- Create, Edit, and Delete Placement Drives (Roles, Packages, CGPA requirements, Deadlines)
- View and Manage all registered Students
- View system statistics (Total Drives, Applications, Shortlisted, etc.)

### 2. Student
Students use this role to interact with the placement drives set up by the college.

**Features:**
- Fill and update personal profile details (College, Branch, CGPA, Skills, Contact)
- Upload Resume (PDF)
- View Active Placement Drives that they are eligible for
- Apply to Placement Drives with a single click
- View their Application History and Status (Applied, Shortlisted, Selected, Rejected)
- **Resume Analyzer**: Upload a resume against a job description to get AI-driven feedback (ATS Match Score, missing keywords, improvement suggestions).

